{
  "id": 1173,
  "description": "# Welcome in Masters of None\n══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n### 🌐Guild Network🌐\n\n🔸Main Guild: Masters of None🔸\n\n🔸Banished/Cursed Guild: Masters of Bane🔸\n\n🔸Alt Guilds: Seekers of None, Adepts of None, Elites of None🔸\n\nWe use the following Guild structure for Players to progress trough and provide a suitable Guild for every Player/Combat Level:\n\n🔸CL 1-40 -&gt;  Seekers of None🔸\n\n🔸CL 40-60 -&gt; Adepts of None🔸\n\n🔸CL 60-80 -&gt; Elites of None🔸\n\n🔸CL (70) 80-100 -&gt; Masters of None🔸\n\nPlease join the Guild appropiate for you CL.\n\n══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n### ✅Requirements✅\n\n🔸Be Active🔸\n\n🔸Combat Level 70🔸\n\n🔸Participate in Raids🔸\n\n🔸Contribute to Stockpile and Challenges if possible🔸\n\n### 🚫Kick Rationale🚫\n\n🔸5 Days Guild Inactivity results in getting kicked🔸\n\n🔸Rare to Low Guild Activity results in getting kicked🔸\n\n══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n### ⚔️Raids⚔️\n\n➡️ Monday-Sunday: 3 Raids Per Day\n\n🔸Raid 1: Skybound Eden (Level 70) 18:00-18:55 (UTC+2)✅ACTIVE✅🔸\n\n🔸Raid 2: Skybound Eden (Level 70) 19:05-20:00 (UTC+2)✅ACTIVE✅🔸\n\n🔸Raid 3: Skybound Eden (Level 70) 20:10-21:05 (UTC+2)✅ACTIVE✅🔸\n\n##### ⚔️ EVERYONE PLEASE PARTICIPATE ⚔️\n\n══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n###  📦Stockpile📦 \n\nTake a quick look at the stockpile, see what we’re low on, and deposit what you can afford to help replenish it. These contributions help cover our guild’s repair costs. It’s not required, but even small and/or regular donations are really appreciated. Only Logs and Bars can be deposited. Longterm Goal is to have 30K from every Resource.\n\nCurrent Material priority for the last Building Slot:\n\nLogs:🔸Mahogany Log🔸Mystical Log🔸\n \nMetal Bars:🔸Chromite Bar🔸Mystic Bar🔸 \n\n══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n### 📞Discord📞\n\nFor those interested here is a Discordlink for the Guild Server: https://discord.gg/qBBPgk8zyZ\n\nRecommended for:\n\n🔸Information and Resources like Tools and Calculators\n\n🔸Raid/World Boss/Shrine alerts\n\n🔸Take part in Decisions, shaping the future of the Guilds\n\n🔸Ask us Questions regarding the Guilds or Game there\n══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════",
